          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "# **Join or create** **a sensemaking community.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Eurosense connects people across Europe who want to understand the world through shared stories.\n\n **Join an existing group, start your own, or learn how to make sense of complex issues together.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Share your Story",
          "href": "https://collector.sensemaker-suite.com/collector?projectID=d1c06283-3a51-4050-ac6d-ea29ae75f32c&ID=eurosense"
        },
        {
