    {
      "id": "6909d3430ab8467199a41945",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "What is Eurosense?"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "# **A citizen network for** **democratic policy making**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Democracy begins with listening. Eurosense makes sure every voice counts"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### Community led initiatives"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "We bring together communities and individuals across Europe to collect real-life stories about what matters most"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**01**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### Sensemaker® technology"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "People share their stories and interpret them in their own words"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**02**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### Stories that become insights"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Stories are turned into insights are are used to guide policy making - making sure you are truly heard"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**03**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "690b1ff05b03133f64d1f52e",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**02**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "How it works?"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "# **Our sensemaker® makes sure your are** **Truly heard**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Sensemaking is a simple, participatory process that helps groups transform shared experiences into deeper understanding and action."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/image-5788561b.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Join or start a community**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Connect with others who care about understanding real experience"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/image-f0ded758.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**04**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Collect stories or Share stories**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Turn insights into ideas, solutions, or initiatives - and inspire other communities across Europe."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/image-c47c0500.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**01**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Make sense together**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Meet in workshops or online sessions to interpret the data and discover shared meaning"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/image-2ea452fd.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**03**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Act and share what you learn**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Use the SenseMaker® tool to gather lived experiences from your community or share your own experinces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "690b2eb35b03133f64d40f30",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Benefits of particiaption"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "# **Why your** **participation matters**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Sensemaking communities are spaces where curiosity meets collaboration. They bring together citizens, researchers, and local leaders to explore what matters most - and to see patterns that no one could see alone."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### Community Matters"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Each story shared through Eurosense adds another perspective to Europe’s collective map of experiences"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**01**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### Citizen Based Information"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Together, these stories reveal what unites us, what challenges we face, and where action is needed"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**02**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### More data - More useful policies"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "The more people share, the clearer the picture becomes — and the stronger our democracy grows"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**03**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "690b7aad94e934251f5c1ad2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Sensemaker® dashboard"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "# **Explore stories that are shaping Europe**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Every story shared through Eurosense contributes to a growing, open database of human experiences. Our public dashboard visualizes these stories - showing emerging patterns, shared emotions, and real-time insights from across Europe."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Join a community",
          "href": "https://collector.sensemaker-suite.com/collector?projectID=d1c06283-3a51-4050-ac6d-ea29ae75f32c&ID=eurosense"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Explore citizen stories",
          "href": "/dashboard"
        }
      ]
