          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Use your voice to shape Europe’s Policies"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "# **Be part of Europe’s growing network of sensemakers**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Whether you join, create, or learn - your participation helps us understand and shape a more connected Europe."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Join a community",
          "href": "https://collector.sensemaker-suite.com/collector?projectID=d1c06283-3a51-4050-ac6d-ea29ae75f32c&ID=eurosense"
        },
        {
